      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I got my Quest the other day, i either load into a black world or i load in and the get kicked home if I'm lucky. when i load into a black world, I can hear everything, but see nothing. only way to get out of it is to exit vrchat. then other times, I'll load in just fine, be hanging out. then everything freezes and all of a sudden vrchat isn't running anymore.",
